ジナル？それともひめたん付けたの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーれはもともとそんなデザインだったよ(ω)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんそーんな器用じゃないないー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/8976847/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの浴衣涼しそう。でも着ている本人は涼しくないんでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーどうだろね。あの会場の中は涼しくていい感じだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お外に出向いたらきっついかもしれないー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっつ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手元にお名前ぺん・コピー用紙・パソコンがない故に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぺこめ返しができないの(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんが帰ってくるの待っちょってちー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-2840":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみん祝★18歳おめでとーう(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２人とも上京して落ち着いたら、またお泊まり会しようね。\nかずみさん（高山一実chan）とお話しするの大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみさん大好きだよっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんいつまでもかずみさんのアイドルでいられるよう頑張るよ(^^)/\nこれからもよろしくね♪ステキ1年になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/02/08/cimg01732.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんきのうはねー\nメンバーのみんなでお話したの。楽しかったよー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え\n何の話か気になりますか(ω)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の話したっけな。\n怖い話とか。\n乃木坂の将来の話とか。\n今度の握手会の話とか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い話本当怖かった(>_<)べびたんと２人で「あーああ怖い怖い怖いっ」てなったし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに春といえば花粉症だけどひめたんは大丈夫な人なの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症めっちゃ大丈夫(ω)えっへん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは「モスチーズバーガー」ですかぁ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの好みはそうですね。モスチーズバーガーですね(*^^*)\nちなみに数あるハンバーガーショップの中で、ひめたんはモスが1番好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは好き嫌い多いのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちっちゃい頃よりは多くないけど、んー好き嫌いがはっきりしとるのは確か。\nシーフード類はほっとんど苦手です('・ω・`)ごめんね\n甘いものは何でも好き!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"typ